<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>67.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <assignments>
        <name>Assign_Sanitized_Content</name>
        <label>마스킹본 출력 변수에 할당</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>sanitizedContent</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Get_Latest_Sanitized_Note.Sanitized_Content__c</elementReference>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
    </assignments>
    <description>영업기회 ID로 Meeting_Note__c 최신 1건을 찾아 Sanitized_Content__c(마스킹본)만 반환한다. Raw_Content__c(원문)는 조회 필드에 포함되지 않는다.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>GetSanitizedMeetingNote {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>GetSanitizedMeetingNote</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordLookups>
        <description>Opportunity__c가 opportunityId와 같은 Meeting_Note__c 중 최신 1건. Sanitized_Content__c만 가져온다.</description>
        <name>Get_Latest_Sanitized_Note</name>
        <label>최신 마스킹본 조회</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Assign_Sanitized_Content</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Opportunity__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>opportunityId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Meeting_Note__c</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Sanitized_Content__c</queriedFields>
        <sortField>CreatedDate</sortField>
        <sortOrder>Desc</sortOrder>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <runInMode>DefaultMode</runInMode>
    <start>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Latest_Sanitized_Note</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
    <variables>
        <description>에이전트가 전달하는 영업기회 ID. 이 ID로 Meeting_Note__c 최신 1건을 찾는다.</description>
        <name>opportunityId</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>true</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
    </variables>
    <variables>
        <description>마스킹본 본문(Sanitized_Content__c). 원문 Raw_Content__c는 이 Flow에서 조회하지 않는다.</description>
        <name>sanitizedContent</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>false</isInput>
        <isOutput>true</isOutput>
    </variables>
</Flow>
